# Dark mode — required

Use semantic tokens that flip automatically in `.dark`:

```tsx
// ✅ Correct — flips automatically
<div className="bg-background text-foreground border border-border" />
<div className="bg-muted text-muted-foreground" />
<div className="bg-accent text-accent-foreground" />

// ⛔ Breaks in dark mode
<div className="bg-white text-[#212121] border-[#eaeaea]" />
```

Test by switching Storybook toolbar to **Dark** before marking any story complete.
